Pull images by digest from a build manifest.

A tag can be pushed again, so a deployment pulling by tag may run images
other than the ones its deployer was built with. When the deployer image
carries a build manifest, each <service>_image_full now resolves through
a kolla_image_full lookup, which pulls the images it names by digest.

Other images, and every image when there is no manifest, are pulled by
tag as before. The deployer checks refuse a manifest built for another
tag, and an unreadable manifest fails rather than falling back to tags.
Moving a deployment to digests recreates each container once.

